clarity purposes, a column at the observation level where it is detailed to
which month the detection corresponds, there is also a final column called A or
B, and this is because the transect was traveled from " round trip" each visit, so the observations labeled A were made when traveling the
transect first thing in the morning and those labeled B upon return. Is data B
somehow usable or should it be discarded?

Thank you very much again.

